module fn_can_stop .
rem run: first [7,8]
rem trap: first []

rem ko: 순수한 `fn` 이지만 빈 줄을 받으면 멈춘다 --- 경계 검사의 멈춤은 op 이 낸 효과가 아니다 /// en: a pure `fn`, yet it stops on an empty slice --- a bounds-check stop is not an effect the op performs
fn first input xs slice u8 . output u8 .
do
  return idx xs. 0 . .
end .
